---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import DiscountCalc from '../../components/calculators/DiscountCalc.astro';
---

<Layout
  lang="en"
  title="Discount Calculator: Sale Price, Stacked Coupons & Savings"
  description="Calculate sale discounts, final price after coupon stacks, and total money saved with our fast and free discount calculator."
  canonicalUrl="https://prozentrechner-online.com/en/discount-calculator"
  alternateUrls={{
    de: "https://prozentrechner-online.com/rabattrechner",
    en: "https://prozentrechner-online.com/en/discount-calculator"
  }}
>
  <!-- Breadcrumb & Header -->
  <div class="mb-8">
    <nav class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold mb-3" style="color: var(--text-muted);">
      <a href="/en" class="hover:underline">Home</a>
      <span>&rsaquo;</span>
      <span style="color: var(--text-ink);">Discount Calculator</span>
    </nav>

    <h1 class="font-display font-black text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl tracking-tight mb-2" style="color: var(--text-ink);">
      Online Discount & Sale Calculator
    </h1>
    <p class="text-sm sm:text-base max-w-2xl" style="color: var(--text-muted);">
      Find out the exact sale price, how much money you save, and compound extra promotional coupons or sales tax in real-time.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Interactive Tool -->
  <div class="mb-16">
    <DiscountCalc lang="en" />
  </div>

  <!-- Deep Guide & SEO Explanations -->
  <div class="rounded-3xl border p-8 sm:p-10 shadow-sm space-y-6" style="background-color: var(--bg-surface); border-color: var(--border-hairline);">
    <h2 class="font-display font-black text-2xl tracking-tight" style="color: var(--text-ink);">
      How to Calculate Discounts: Formula & Methods
    </h2>

    <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--text-muted);">
      A discount represents a percentage reduction from the original list price of a product or service. To calculate a discount by hand:
    </p>

    <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl border font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm space-y-1" style="background-color: var(--bg-surface-soft); border-color: var(--border-hairline);">
      <div class="font-bold text-pink-600 dark:text-pink-400">Discount Amount = Original Price × (Discount% ÷ 100)</div>
      <div class="font-bold text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400">Final Price = Original Price − Discount Amount</div>
    </div>

    <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-lg pt-2" style="color: var(--text-ink);">
      Example: 30% Off an $80 Jacket
    </h3>
    <ol class="list-decimal list-inside space-y-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm" style="color: var(--text-body);">
      <li>Multiply the original price by 0.30: <code>$80 × 0.30 = $24</code> (Amount Saved).</li>
      <li>Subtract the savings from the original price: <code>$80 − $24 = $56</code> (Final Sale Price).</li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</Layout>
